    "body": "Support for this architecture was added with #2137. Builds should be available in the next release.\r\n\r\nFor now you could try compiling your own binaries natively with `cargo install starship`. You can get a rust toolchain from [rustup.rs](https://rustup.rs). If you have trouble with that you could try cross-compiling with [cross](https://github.com/rust-embedded/cross) via `cross build --target aarch64-unknown-linux-musl --release --features tls-vendored` from a different system.",
